From 20335dff1e4dd2dedf9d28625e6d96e4158108b7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 14:14:15 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] fix(v2): keep branch controls open across branch switches
 (#179)

Keying rows by message id remounted a row's branch controls whenever
a branch switch changed its id. Key persisted rows by turn and role
(one active row per pair) so reorder still keeps the panel on the same
message and a branch switch keeps it open. Add a screen test for the
switch case.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Cv4a6DRnNXdGwnDbUv9bT3
---
